—Mama Odie', 'Mario Oscar Gabriele'),
('Lose the Way', 'LC-1262', (SELECT id FROM inks WHERE name = 'Amethyst'), NULL, (SELECT id FROM card_sets WHERE name = 'Azurite Sea'), (SELECT id FROM rarities WHERE name = 'Uncommon'), 2, TRUE, '/assets/cards/lorcana_en_set6_63_cd9f002fc23a0eafe2c2ef2351eced8475a0140a.avif', '<p>Exert chosen character. Then, you may choose and discard a card. If you do, the exerted character can''t ready at the start of their next turn.</p>', '63/204 EN 6', 'actions', '"Well, when one''s lost, I suppose it’s good advice to stay where you are until someone finds you.”
