('Seeking the Half Crown', 'LC-1263', (SELECT id FROM inks WHERE name = 'Amethyst'), NULL, (SELECT id FROM card_sets WHERE name = 'Azurite Sea'), (SELECT id FROM rarities WHERE name = 'Rare'), 5, FALSE, '/assets/cards/lorcana_en_set6_64_85082444f8d9f9ed35213960a27b90d7517120cd.avif', '<p>For each Sorcerer character you have in play, you pay 1 {I} less to play this action.</p><p>Draw 2 cards.</p>', '64/204 EN 6', 'actions', '“I see the other half, in the Inklands. Quick, my tiny companion! Fetch me that crown!”
